  "the campaign's camera. first person is the game's own view. third person follows samus from behind, wearing her suit's body.": "冒险模式视角。第一人称为原版视角；第三人称跟随萨姆斯身后。",
  "match\ncamera": "对战\n镜头",
  "the camera in multiplayer matches. third person follows your hunter from behind in bot and lan matches. online matches are always first person.": "机器人和局域网对战支持第三人称，在线对战始终采用第一人称。",
  "map\nlook": "地图\n样式",
  "map: the game's own map models. detailed: every room drawn from its real shape. y switches it in the map.": "原版显示游戏地图模型，详细模式按实际地形绘制，可在地图中按 Y 切换。",
  "map\nmode": "地图\n模式",
  "prime: only rooms and corridors you've been in. move freely, the d-pad hops rooms. hunters: the game's own.": "究极模式只显示已到访区域，可自由移动或用十字键切换房间。Hunters 为原版。",
  "prime: in the campaign a radar plus a mini map of the room you're in. ds: the game's own.": "究极：冒险模式显示雷达与房间小地图。DS：原版界面。",
  "change which buttons do what, and how quickly you turn and aim.": "自定义按键、转向速度和瞄准灵敏度。",
  "gyro\naim": "体感\n瞄准",
  "turn the device to fine-tune your aim. the right stick still turns as usual. zoom: only while zoomed or scanning.": "转动设备微调瞄准，右摇杆仍可转向。放大模式仅在放大或扫描时启用。",
  "gyro\nspeed": "体感\n速度",
  "how far the view turns for each turn of the device. 100% turns it the same angle.": "调整体感转向倍率，100% 时，视角转过的角度和设备一致。",
  "reset\ngyro speed": "重置\n体感速度",
  "gyro\naxis": "体感\n轴向",
  "yaw: the screen's own up axis. player: true up, however you hold it. roll: tilt to steer.": "偏航以屏幕竖轴为准；世界以实际竖直方向为准；横滚通过侧倾控制。",
